Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Behaviours:
- Reuse SnoozeMenuButton before Settle in folder and folder-multiline hover actions, with the existing availability gate, presets, custom dialog, environment and open-state handling.
- When Snooze is shown, stack the time label and the Snooze/Settle controls in one grid cell so the status slot always reserves the wider of the two; hover, keyboard focus and the open menu only swap opacity, so long titles truncate at the same point at rest and on hover. Woke rows keep the label beside the controls. Preserve Woke presentation. Without Snooze, keep the upstream Settle overlay and its Woke behavior. Keep controls available while the menu is open and suppress the enclosing details tooltip.
- Keep Snooze out of settled/snoozed slim rows. Preserve card rows, settle/unsettle actions and snoozed/Woke status decisions. Web, desktop renderer and mobile browser share these row variants; native mobile, server and providers are unchanged.

Integration details:
- Preserve upstream grouped Settle tooltips, jump-hint status slot/badge, rem-based row heights and button keyboard accessibility.

Port to 965ddc1d6c:
- Applied without conflicts. On 965ddc1d6c folder and folder-multiline rows still offer only Settle (SidebarThreadRow.tsx did not change upstream), so grouped Snooze still needs this commit.

Files:
apps/web:
- apps/web/src/components/sidebar/SidebarThreadRow.browser.test.tsx
- apps/web/src/components/sidebar/SidebarThreadRow.tsx

Tests:
- apps/web/src/components/sidebar/SidebarThreadRow.browser.test.tsx renders a folder row at 280 px with Snooze and Settle available and measures the title: 192 px at rest, on hover (controls at opacity 1) and after the pointer leaves. Without this layout the same test measured 172 px on hover.
- Focused web set: 247 passed across 14 files; @t3tools/web typecheck, vp lint and vp fmt --check on the changed files passed.
- Whole-stack focused validation on 965ddc1d6c: 1,321 passed and 2 baseline failures across 48 test files (every test file the stack touches plus CommandPalette.logic.test.ts and chatRouteCommands.browser.test.ts). Web: 679 / 32 files; desktop: 118 / 9; server: 432 passed and 2 baseline failures / 4; contracts: 36 / 1; scripts: 56 / 2.
- vp run typecheck passed in apps/web, apps/desktop, apps/server, packages/contracts and scripts; vp lint and vp fmt --check passed on the 119 changed files.
- Baseline: UsageService.test.ts on detached 965ddc1d6c fails the same 2 assertions (Pi /var versus /private/var path equality; Codex open-spy raw-path equality); no assertion was changed to hide them.
- No installed-client or live remote/relay/tunnel pass: no development servers or installed app changes were authorized.

Model/harness: GPT-6 / Codex; hover layout follow-up: Claude Opus 5.5 / Claude Code; port to 965ddc1d6c: Claude Opus 5.5 / Claude Code.
